              "path": ["api", "study-plan", "generate"]
            },
            "description": "Async: names up to 3 owned mother folder ids (any owned discipline, including one with no quiz attempts yet) to target instead of the automatic weakest-3 ranking. Responds 202 immediately; poll \"Get Study Plan\" afterward. Errors: 400 if more than 3 distinct ids are named, 404 if any named id is not an owned mother folder — neither enqueues a generation."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Study Plan",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/study-plan",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "study-plan"]
            },
            "description": "The caller's current plan. generatedAt is null with an empty steps list if a plan was never generated. Each selected discipline contributes a fixed 3-step sequence (REVIEW_SUMMARY, REVIEW_FLASHCARDS, RETAKE_QUIZ) against its target childFolderId. A deleted mother/child folder shows as \"(pasta excluída)\" but the step still returns."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('fetched', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (Array.isArray(body.steps) && body.steps.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('study_plan_step_id', body.steps[0].id);",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Complete Study Plan Step",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/study-plan/steps/{{study_plan_step_id}}/complete",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "study-plan", "steps", "{{study_plan_step_id}}", "complete"]
            },
            "description": "Marks one of the caller's own current-plan steps as completed. 204 on success, 404 if the step doesn't exist or belongs to another owner's plan. Regenerating the plan resets completion progress."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
